# Row I6.3, a candidate's deletion request and the deletion log.
# Asking: the recruiter only. Every other role in the tenant gets the route's not-found (lib/interviews/gate.ts); callers
# stopped at the tenant gate still get 403. The recruiter's line sends no confirmation: 400, nothing removed.
POST /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.mateo}/deletion | interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter | {"confirm":false}
# The log: the recruiter and the opening's hiring manager.
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.mateo}/deletions | interviewer interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.ravi}/deletions  | hiringManager interviewer | recruiter
